(4269140, 616786, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>LOL!  Great photo &amp; concept!</b>  I really hope you got all your "ducks in a row" and took a photo of the completed concept <b>before</b> you added the words!  <br/> <br/>(Otherwise, you have a DQ on your hands, My Friend,...unfortunately &amp; sadly so.  I DO mean sadly...for I love this!  I pray that this lady doesn''t get a <b>third</b> term or all men in the U.S. will need to begin wearing a "catcher''s cup" as standard issue dress wear...:})  Mark me a 10 on the emotional factor alone!  :)</td>', 'LOL!  Great photo & concept!  I really hope you got all your "ducks in a row" and took a photo of the completed concept before you added the words!   (Otherwise, you have a DQ on your hands, My Friend,...unfortunately & sadly so.  I DO mean sadly...for I love this!  I pray that this lady doesn''t get a third term or all men in the U.S. will need to begin wearing a "catcher''s cup" as standard issue dress wear...:})  Mark me a 10 on the emotional factor alone!  :)', '2007-11-26 06:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
