(4269147, 615687, 68035, '<td valign="top">Well done on both meeting the challenge perfectly (the hooded figure is a great touch) and also producing such a beautiful image.  Love the composition and colours and the skyline almost looks like an erupting volcano<br/> <br/>Gret job</td>', 'Well done on both meeting the challenge perfectly (the hooded figure is a great touch) and also producing such a beautiful image.  Love the composition and colours and the skyline almost looks like an erupting volcano Gret job', '2007-11-26 06:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4269149, 616412, 7786, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image, very sharp but adding text is not legal in Advanced Editing.</td>', 'This is a nice image, very sharp but adding text is not legal in Advanced Editing.', '2007-11-26 06:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4269151, 616463, 68035, '<td valign="top">very nice shot great colouring on the balloon and superb sharpness.  I just wonder what it might have ooked like with the ground cropped out so it appeared that it was high in the sky as the markers and the green open shed like thing are a bit distracting<br/>A minor point on a lovely image</td>', 'very nice shot great colouring on the balloon and superb sharpness.  I just wonder what it might have ooked like with the ground cropped out so it appeared that it was high in the sky as the markers and the green open shed like thing are a bit distractingA minor point on a lovely image', '2007-11-26 06:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4269153, 615631, 68035, '<td valign="top">Stunning winter landscape...So many lovely things in this picture, the crispness and clarity of it, the reverse s curve but it is the trees that get me, as you appear to go from standard colour on the road to duotone in the background.  The transformation is done very gently (with the light doing the job on the trees by the road) but the overall effect is very impressive</td>', 'Stunning winter landscape...So many lovely things in this picture, the crispness and clarity of it, the reverse s curve but it is the trees that get me, as you appear to go from standard colour on the road to duotone in the background.  The transformation is done very gently (with the light doing the job on the trees by the road) but the overall effect is very impressive', '2007-11-26 06:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4269156, 615936, 68035, '<td valign="top">very funny idea and the way you have brought out the ''instructions'' on the shampoo is excellent</td>', 'very funny idea and the way you have brought out the ''instructions'' on the shampoo is excellent', '2007-11-26 06:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
