(4269172, 615286, 68035, '<td valign="top">I have no doubt that some people will feel that this shot is too simple, but to me I look at it and see just a thing of beauty, wonderful colours and tonal range and the faintness of the mountains as they recede into the background is just stunning   9</td>', 'I have no doubt that some people will feel that this shot is too simple, but to me I look at it and see just a thing of beauty, wonderful colours and tonal range and the faintness of the mountains as they recede into the background is just stunning   9', '2007-11-26 07:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
