(4269265, 616789, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky patterns. Tonal range in sky is amazing and so the image as a whole is let down by the trees and ground which have relatively low contrast. Opening up the levels at the low end to bring out the trees would have taken away the focus from the lovely sky and so I think post processing the trees to become a silhouette might have been more effective</td>', 'Lovely sky patterns. Tonal range in sky is amazing and so the image as a whole is let down by the trees and ground which have relatively low contrast. Opening up the levels at the low end to bring out the trees would have taken away the focus from the lovely sky and so I think post processing the trees to become a silhouette might have been more effective', '2007-11-26 08:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
