(4270158, 616728, 7786, '<td valign="top">Nice image you captured. But I would have cropped it differently. The upper half of it has little to offer. I would have had less cloud and more foreground or at least have the birds higher up. But in all a good and well exposed picture.</td>', 'Nice image you captured. But I would have cropped it differently. The upper half of it has little to offer. I would have had less cloud and more foreground or at least have the birds higher up. But in all a good and well exposed picture.', '2007-11-26 18:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
