(4270970, 616663, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely vertical wide angle. The island could be a bit sharper but apart from that, lovely rich colours and well composed</td>', 'Lovely vertical wide angle. The island could be a bit sharper but apart from that, lovely rich colours and well composed', '2007-11-27 08:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270973, 616677, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and rich shadows. Composition wise, the horizon is right smack in the middle, would have been better to go with the recommended rule of thirds.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and rich shadows. Composition wise, the horizon is right smack in the middle, would have been better to go with the recommended rule of thirds.', '2007-11-27 08:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270974, 616519, 81382, '<td valign="top">Well composed, would have been great if the gun and smoke were more in focus. Good choice of duotone hue, gives it the "wild west" look</td>', 'Well composed, would have been great if the gun and smoke were more in focus. Good choice of duotone hue, gives it the "wild west" look', '2007-11-27 08:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270975, 616185, 23484, '<td valign="top">Stunning shot. This should have been entered in a Free Study.</td>', 'Stunning shot. This should have been entered in a Free Study.', '2007-11-27 08:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270978, 616610, 81382, '<td valign="top">Good colours,a little bit of camera shake though which is a shame, quite noisy too in places but I guess thats expected with the lighting conditions. Could almost do with a little ccw rotation.</td>', 'Good colours,a little bit of camera shake though which is a shame, quite noisy too in places but I guess thats expected with the lighting conditions. Could almost do with a little ccw rotation.', '2007-11-27 08:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270981, 615910, 81382, '<td valign="top">Just not sharp enough throughout the whole image to be effective.</td>', 'Just not sharp enough throughout the whole image to be effective.', '2007-11-27 08:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270982, 615349, 81382, '<td valign="top">Lovely rich colours and good tonal range. Moody looking clouds and great still reflections. A slight ccw rotating during the cropping stage to square up the horizon is the only thing I can point out.</td>', 'Lovely rich colours and good tonal range. Moody looking clouds and great still reflections. A slight ccw rotating during the cropping stage to square up the horizon is the only thing I can point out.', '2007-11-27 08:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270985, 616309, 81382, '<td valign="top">The noise and rather washed out colours make this appear rather flat. Some nice DOF effects with more defined focus on the fairy lights and then tailing off to a blurry background would have provided the depth required to give this more impact</td>', 'The noise and rather washed out colours make this appear rather flat. Some nice DOF effects with more defined focus on the fairy lights and then tailing off to a blurry background would have provided the depth required to give this more impact', '2007-11-27 08:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4270987, 616773, 81382, '<td valign="top">Excellent view, lovely lighting and rich shadows. Could almost have done with a bit of dodging and burning just to really beef up the rocky landscape to provide a bit more variety in places and a real punch</td>', 'Excellent view, lovely lighting and rich shadows. Could almost have done with a bit of dodging and burning just to really beef up the rocky landscape to provide a bit more variety in places and a real punch', '2007-11-27 08:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
