(4278426, 614939, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seattle is a beautiful city -- it''s nice to see a different angle other than the stereotypical one from Kerry Park (which I''m guilty of hunting down when I was there this summer!).  You picked an excellent time of the evening to shoot it, too.</td>', 'Seattle is a beautiful city -- it''s nice to see a different angle other than the stereotypical one from Kerry Park (which I''m guilty of hunting down when I was there this summer!).  You picked an excellent time of the evening to shoot it, too.', '2007-11-30 14:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4278428, 616185, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  It''s awfully hard to pull off a decent shot into the sun, but you did it perfectly.  Those guys are making me nervous just looking at the shot -- I think my fear of heights would kick in pretty quickly for that kind of job.</td>', 'Very cool shot!  It''s awfully hard to pull off a decent shot into the sun, but you did it perfectly.  Those guys are making me nervous just looking at the shot -- I think my fear of heights would kick in pretty quickly for that kind of job.', '2007-11-30 14:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
