(4281660, 615936, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is really really really really really really really really really really really really really really real..... funny. gotta give you a 10 for the best answer to the original question.</td>', 'This is really really really really really really really really really really really really really really real..... funny. gotta give you a 10 for the best answer to the original question.', '2007-12-02 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
