(4281755, 615286, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent multi-tier hillscape (if that''s a word).  The haze really adds to this.  It looks like cut-out sheets of cardboard behind each other...in a good way.</td>', 'Excellent multi-tier hillscape (if that''s a word).  The haze really adds to this.  It looks like cut-out sheets of cardboard behind each other...in a good way.', '2007-12-02 01:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4281776, 616526, 76430, '<td valign="top">Haven''t I see this costume here before?  I don''t remember where.  Nice shot.  The man looking out over the lake adds a lot.</td>', 'Haven''t I see this costume here before?  I don''t remember where.  Nice shot.  The man looking out over the lake adds a lot.', '2007-12-02 01:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4281784, 616553, 76430, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of Fiji or French Polynesia.  I love the sun rays coming through the clouds.  Good silhouette of the land and trees.</td>', 'This reminds me of Fiji or French Polynesia.  I love the sun rays coming through the clouds.  Good silhouette of the land and trees.', '2007-12-02 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
