(4282278, 616241, 79720, '<td valign="top">That''s outstanding! Just call you "Danger Photographer". Nice capture, hope you got out of the way in time.</td>', 'That''s outstanding! Just call you "Danger Photographer". Nice capture, hope you got out of the way in time.', '2007-12-02 09:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
