(4282288, 615907, 79720, '<td valign="top">There''s a grey cast to your image that leads me to believe your post-processing routine let you down. Use the middle, grey slider in the levels to help with the midtone contrast.</td>', 'There''s a grey cast to your image that leads me to believe your post-processing routine let you down. Use the middle, grey slider in the levels to help with the midtone contrast.', '2007-12-02 09:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
