(4284442, 616786, 81301, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by OmanOtter:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t think it''s a great photo, but I don''t think it''s this bad, either.  There must be an awful lot of Democrats on this site. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Sean, thank you for your comment, and thanks to the others that took the time.<br/> <br/>i wasnt going to participate in this challenge but happened to see this nutcracker, its a real nutcracker that is being sold in a lot of stores in New York, with this package that shows in the photo - i only changed the BG paper to blue.<br/> <br/>i know exactly what technically is wrong with this photo - she is off center and the writing is not straight - again, it''s a photo of the whole package. the blue BG is a tiny noisy.<br/> <br/>other than these 3 faults, there are NO other technical faults.<br/> <br/>i think this was (is) really funny but people here obviously had to "show" me something... what exactly they wanted to "show", i dont know, they havent had the courage to say... at least not during the time for comments and voting.<br/> <br/>frankly, i am disgusted with the reaction to this photo.<br/> <br/>this photo is not a 1 a 2 or a 3, not technically and not by interest - i had about 350 views during voting just a bit more than the majority on the first page!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-03 01:18:04.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by OmanOtter: I don''t think it''s a great photo, but I don''t think it''s this bad, either.  There must be an awful lot of Democrats on this site.   Sean, thank you for your comment, and thanks to the others that took the time. i wasnt going to participate in this challenge but happened to see this nutcracker, its a real nutcracker that is being sold in a lot of stores in New York, with this package that shows in the photo - i only changed the BG paper to blue. i know exactly what technically is wrong with this photo - she is off center and the writing is not straight - again, it''s a photo of the whole package. the blue BG is a tiny noisy. other than these 3 faults, there are NO other technical faults. i think this was (is) really funny but people here obviously had to "show" me something... what exactly they wanted to "show", i dont know, they havent had the courage to say... at least not during the time for comments and voting. frankly, i am disgusted with the reaction to this photo. this photo is not a 1 a 2 or a 3, not technically and not by interest - i had about 350 views during voting just a bit more than the majority on the first page!', '2007-12-03 00:32:40.000000', '2007-12-03 01:18:04.000000', 0),
